   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to Forest Europe_2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Pr&#xED;spevok do Forest Europe 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;FOREST EUROPE je najvy&#x161;&#x161;&#xED;m politick&#xFD;m gr&#xE9;miom eur&#xF3;pskych ministrov zodpovedn&#xFD;ch za lesn&#xE9; hospod&#xE1;rstvo. SR sa v r&#xE1;mci plnenia rozhodnutia ministrov o podpore lesov a lesn&#xED;ctva na Ukrajine v roku 2023 zaviazala poskytn&#xFA;&#x165; mimoriadny finan&#x10D;n&#xFD; pr&#xED;spevok vo v&#xFD;&#x161;ke 8 849,00 EUR na v&#xFD;hradn&#xE9; pou&#x17E;itie na aktivity sekretari&#xE1;tu FOREST EUROPE, ktor&#xE9; s&#xFA;visia s podporou lesov a lesn&#xED;ctva na Ukrajine.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Within the framework of the implementation of the decision of the Ministers on the support of forests and forestry in Ukraine in 2023, the Slovak Republic provided a financial contribution in the amount of EUR 8,849.00 for exclusive use for the activities of the FOREST EUROPE secretariat, which are related to the support of forests and forestry in Ukraine&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
